title: 'Notify: add --list-targets flag to enumerate available chat/channel targets'
updated_at: "2026-08-01T17:35:53Z"
---
The notify command currently requires knowing the target chat ID or conversation ID ahead of time. Add a --list-targets flag that discovers and lists available targets for each channel type:

Telegram:
- Call getUpdates to enumerate known chats the bot has interacted with
- Show chat ID, chat type (private/group/channel), and title/name

Teams:
- Enumerate recent conversations via Bot Framework API
- Show conversation ID, conversation type, and name/title

Usage: clawq notify --channel telegram --list-targets [--account name]
Usage: clawq notify --channel teams --list-targets